{"candidateAnswer":"no, her older brother taught her","evidence":"[D2:28 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: Even as a child I learned to play on my own.\n[D24:8 | 2:14 pm on 3 September, 2023] Jolene: I taught myself, but my dad was always supportive and my mom would play games with me. ","itemId":"urn:uuid:ccc19ea2-b6bc-582b-897c-ab8f21a2010f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ca12e80653881e375fdc9e1acb73451e7afe5f5be8b7b9764f64a2007b34de14","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Did Jolene teach herself how to play the console?","referenceAnswer":"yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ca12e80653881e375fdc9e1acb73451e7afe5f5be8b7b9764f64a2007b34de14"}}]}